rxlib_check.py  libpcre2-8 10.46 2025-08-27  python 3.14.4  sabotage=False

PART A  harness selfcheck
  OK  NO_AUTO_POSSESS (0x4000): `a+(?C)b` on `aaac` callouts with the option 6, without 3 (expect 6 and 3)
  OK  NO_START_OPTIMIZE (0x10000): `(?C)abc` on `xxabd` callouts 6 (expect 6: every start tried)
  OK  MATCH_UNSET_BACKREF (0x200): `(?:(?<a>a)|x)\k<a>b` on `xb` default None, with the option (0, 2, {'a': None}) (expect None, a match)
  OK  callout as a condition, callout TRUE: bare `x(?(?C)(?=)a|b)` matches xa/xb True/False ; inside a lookahead `x(?(?=(?C))a|b)` True/False (expect T/F, T/F)
  OK  callout as a condition, callout FALSE: bare `x(?(?C)(?=)a|b)` matches xa/xb False/False ; inside a lookahead `x(?(?=(?C))a|b)` False/True (expect F/F, F/T)
  OK  ANCHORED|ENDANCHORED (WHOLE): `\d+` whole on `12` True, on `12x` False, on `x12` False

PART B  the three before/after examples (note section 1)

B1  every item of a list under 5
  BEFORE: item := /(?<h>\d)/ & (h: <5)   then   /(?:${item};)*/
  AFTER : item := [h = rx.digit] & (h: <5)   then   rx.loop(item € ";")
  BEFORE regex model: (?:(?:(?<h>\d)(?C"b1"));)*
  AFTER  expansion:   (?:(?:(?<h>\d)(?C"c1"))(?:\;)){0,}
  INTENT (Python re): (?:[0-4];)*
    on '3;7;'     BEFORE (False, (0, 2, ('3',)), ((0, 2, ('3',)), (2, 2, (None,)), (3, 3, (None,)), (4, 4, (None,))))
    on '3;7;'     AFTER  (False, (0, 2, ('3',)), ((0, 2, ('3',)), (2, 2, (None,)), (3, 3, (None,)), (4, 4, (None,))))
    on '3;3;'     BEFORE (True, (0, 4, ('3',)), ((0, 4, ('3',)), (4, 4, (None,))))
    on '3;3;'     AFTER  (True, (0, 4, ('3',)), ((0, 4, ('3',)), (4, 4, (None,))))
    on '7;3;'     BEFORE (False, (0, 0, (None,)), ((0, 0, (None,)), (1, 1, (None,)), (2, 4, ('3',)), (4, 4, (None,))))
    on '7;3;'     AFTER  (False, (0, 0, (None,)), ((0, 0, (None,)), (1, 1, (None,)), (2, 4, ('3',)), (4, 4, (None,))))
    on '3;;'      BEFORE (False, (0, 2, ('3',)), ((0, 2, ('3',)), (2, 2, (None,)), (3, 3, (None,))))
    on '3;;'      AFTER  (False, (0, 2, ('3',)), ((0, 2, ('3',)), (2, 2, (None,)), (3, 3, (None,))))
  over 364 texts: BEFORE vs AFTER differ WHOLE 0; SEARCHED 0; FIND-ALL 0 (first None)
  over 364 texts: AFTER vs INTENT differ WHOLE 0; SEARCHED 0; FIND-ALL 0 (first None)

B2  a time of day, labelled parts, a condition on the hour
  BEFORE: t2 := /(?<h>\d{1,2})(?::(?<m>\d\d))?/   then   t2 & (h: <13)
  AFTER : t2 := [h = rx.digits(1, 2)] € rx.optional(":" € [m = rx.digits(2, 2)])   then   t2 & (h: <13)
  BEFORE regex model: (?<h>\d{1,2})(?::(?<m>\d\d))?(?C"b2")
  AFTER  expansion:   (?:(?<h>\d{1,2}))(?:(?:(?:\:)(?:(?<m>\d{2,2})))?)(?C"c2")
  INTENT (Python re): (?:1[0-2]|\d)(?::\d\d)?
    on '14:30'    BEFORE (False, (0, 1, ('1', None)), ((0, 1, ('1', None)), (1, 5, ('4', '30'))))
    on '14:30'    AFTER  (False, (0, 1, ('1', None)), ((0, 1, ('1', None)), (1, 5, ('4', '30'))))
    on '9:30'     BEFORE (True, (0, 4, ('9', '30')), ((0, 4, ('9', '30')),))
    on '9:30'     AFTER  (True, (0, 4, ('9', '30')), ((0, 4, ('9', '30')),))
    on '12:45'    BEFORE (True, (0, 5, ('12', '45')), ((0, 5, ('12', '45')),))
    on '12:45'    AFTER  (True, (0, 5, ('12', '45')), ((0, 5, ('12', '45')),))
    on '00:30'    BEFORE (False, (0, 1, ('0', None)), ((0, 1, ('0', None)), (1, 5, ('0', '30'))))
    on '00:30'    AFTER  (False, (0, 1, ('0', None)), ((0, 1, ('0', None)), (1, 5, ('0', '30'))))
    on '9:30 14:00' BEFORE (False, (0, 4, ('9', '30')), ((0, 4, ('9', '30')), (5, 6, ('1', None)), (6, 10, ('4', '00'))))
    on '9:30 14:00' AFTER  (False, (0, 4, ('9', '30')), ((0, 4, ('9', '30')), (5, 6, ('1', None)), (6, 10, ('4', '00'))))
  over 3906 texts: BEFORE vs AFTER differ WHOLE 0; SEARCHED 0; FIND-ALL 0 (first None)
  over 3906 texts: AFTER vs INTENT differ WHOLE 0; SEARCHED 0; FIND-ALL 0 (first None)

B3  an alternation, a label in both branches, a condition outside it
  BEFORE: A := /(?<l>\d)\d/, B := /(?<l>\d\d)/   then   (B | A) & (l: <20)
  AFTER : A := [l = rx.digit] € rx.digit, B := [l = rx.digits(2, 2)]   then   (B | A) & (l: <20)
  BEFORE regex model: (?|(?<l>\d\d)|(?<l>\d)\d)(?C"b3")
  AFTER  expansion:   (?|(?<l>\d{2,2})|(?:(?<l>\d))(?:\d))(?C"c3")
  INTENT (Python re): \d\d
    on '25'       BEFORE (True, (0, 2, ('2',)), ((0, 2, ('2',)),))
    on '25'       AFTER  (True, (0, 2, ('2',)), ((0, 2, ('2',)),))
    on '15'       BEFORE (True, (0, 2, ('15',)), ((0, 2, ('15',)),))
    on '15'       AFTER  (True, (0, 2, ('15',)), ((0, 2, ('15',)),))
    on '25 13'    BEFORE (False, (0, 2, ('2',)), ((0, 2, ('2',)), (3, 5, ('13',))))
    on '25 13'    AFTER  (False, (0, 2, ('2',)), ((0, 2, ('2',)), (3, 5, ('13',))))
    on '05'       BEFORE (True, (0, 2, ('0',)), ((0, 2, ('0',)),))
    on '05'       AFTER  (True, (0, 2, ('0',)), ((0, 2, ('0',)),))
  over 341 texts: BEFORE vs AFTER differ WHOLE 0; SEARCHED 0; FIND-ALL 0 (first None)
  over 341 texts: AFTER vs INTENT differ WHOLE 0; SEARCHED 0; FIND-ALL 0 (first None)

PART C  the separator loop's definition (plain; Python re against a split oracle)
