    the ONE-COPY form (conditional group) (?:(?(<s>)(?:\,))(?:[ab])(?<s>)){0,}     differ 0 of 1093 (first None)
  loop([ab], min=1, max=inf, sep=",") = (?:[ab])(?:(?:\,)(?:[ab])){0,}                   differ 0 of 1093 (first None)
    the ONE-COPY form (conditional group) (?:(?(<s>)(?:\,))(?:[ab])(?<s>)){1,}     differ 0 of 1093 (first None)
  loop([ab], min=0, max=1, sep=",") = (?:(?:[ab])(?:(?:\,)(?:[ab])){0,0})?             differ 0 of 1093 (first None)
    the ONE-COPY form (conditional group) (?:(?(<s>)(?:\,))(?:[ab])(?<s>)){0,1}    differ 0 of 1093 (first None)
  loop([ab], min=0, max=2, sep=",") = (?:(?:[ab])(?:(?:\,)(?:[ab])){0,1})?             differ 0 of 1093 (first None)
    the ONE-COPY form (conditional group) (?:(?(<s>)(?:\,))(?:[ab])(?<s>)){0,2}    differ 0 of 1093 (first None)
  loop([ab], min=2, max=3, sep=",") = (?:[ab])(?:(?:\,)(?:[ab])){1,2}                  differ 0 of 1093 (first None)
    the ONE-COPY form (conditional group) (?:(?(<s>)(?:\,))(?:[ab])(?<s>)){2,3}    differ 0 of 1093 (first None)
  loop([ab], min=3, max=3, sep=",") = (?:[ab])(?:(?:\,)(?:[ab])){2,2}                  differ 0 of 1093 (first None)
    the ONE-COPY form (conditional group) (?:(?(<s>)(?:\,))(?:[ab])(?<s>)){3,3}    differ 0 of 1093 (first None)

PART D  where a condition stands in a sequence (note section 3)
  (A & (h: <5)) € B  =  (?:(?<h>\d)(?C"dA"))(?:(?:(?:\;)(?:(?<m>\d)))?)
  (A € B) & (h: <5)  =  (?:(?<h>\d))(?:(?:(?:\;)(?:(?<m>\d)))?)(?C"dB")
  c reads only A's label: differ WHOLE 0; SEARCHED 0; FIND-ALL 0 of 364
    on '3;7' first (True, (0, 3, ('3', '7')), ((0, 3, ('3', '7')),)) | second (True, (0, 3, ('3', '7')), ((0, 3, ('3', '7')),))
    on '7;3' first (False, (2, 3, ('3', None)), ((2, 3, ('3', None)),)) | second (False, (2, 3, ('3', None)), ((2, 3, ('3', None)),))
  c reads B's label m:  differ WHOLE 2; SEARCHED 66; FIND-ALL 66 of 364
    on '3;3' early (False, None, ()) | late (True, (0, 3, ('3', '3')), ((0, 3, ('3', '3')),))
    on '3;7' early (False, None, ()) | late (False, None, ())

PART E  the same label twice: what PCRE reads for a duplicate name (backreference, no callout)
  (?J)(?'h'\d)(?:;(?'h'\d))?=\k<h>             two groups named h, both set: \k<h> reads: 3;7=3 HOLDS, 3;7=7 fails, 3=3 HOLDS
  (?J)(?'h'\d)(?:;(?'h'\d))*=\k<h>             separator loop with the item written twice: 1;2;3=1 HOLDS, 1;2;3=3 fails
  (?:(?'h'\d);)*=\k<h>                         one group in a loop (the last-pass control): 1;2;3;=1 fails, 1;2;3;=3 HOLDS
  (?:(?(<s>);)(?'h'\d)(?<s>))*=\k<h>           the one-copy separator loop (conditional group): 1;2;3=1 fails, 1;2;3=3 HOLDS

SUMMARY: PART A failures + PART B and PART C (two-copy form) differences = 0 (forward run expects 0; RXLIB_SABOTAGE=1 must move it)
